00:06:10,130 --> 00:06:15,710
And it's sort of good programming style to do that, especially in a more object-oriented programming.

60
00:06:15,730 --> 00:06:21,130
And so you don't want the overhead, the extra number of steps taken to invoke

61
00:06:21,130 --> 00:06:28,790
a procedure and deal with all those aspects to take any more time than it needs to, because it's a fairly

62
00:06:28,790 --> 00:06:35,990
critical overhead. So one of the things they do in this is they only do whatever

63
00:06:35,990 --> 00:06:43,750
is absolutely needed. So in particular, if no local storage is needed for data, then don't

