00:06:43,750 --> 00:06:47,990
allocate it and therefore don't free it. If you're not passing any values,

65
00:06:47,990 --> 00:06:54,850
don't pass them. And in general, sort of how little can you get away with? And that makes

66
00:06:54,850 --> 00:06:59,710
it a little bit confusing from a teaching point of view and that there's no set

